	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quae ex <placeName>Palatinatu</placeName> multarum literarum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>relatione in compendium contractum Germanice idque <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>in gratiam utriusque consulis nostri, quibus totum negoti<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>um referre oportebat, quod ipsorum iussu amandas<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sem nuncium, contraxi, tibi ea lege communico, ut <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>lecta remittas tuto et non quibuslibet communices, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>imo priora nemini ostendas; posteriora de reformatione <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>eius commonstrare poteris, cui volueris, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>imprimis d. <persName ref="p8160">Believrio</persName>, cui officiosissime ex me sa<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>lutem dicas, oro, et significes me ab illo duo po<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>stulare: primum certum aliquid de rebus <placeName ref="l2510">Turcicis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et Italicis, de quibus sermones vulgi adeo variant, - <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>scit ille certo, sat scio, quid rerum agatur -, secundum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ut nobis paret aut conquirat formam foederis inter <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>papam et <placeName ref="l2448">5 Pagos</placeName> feriendi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> scribit his <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>diebus se accepisse a quodam viro istarum rerum non <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ignaro foedus nondum esse conclusum; expectari adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ammanum <persName>Lussium</persName> <placeName ref="l425">Roma</placeName> brevi rediturum cum plena <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>potestate et crumena.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Conditiones ait fere tales <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>proponi: si ipsi religionis causa lacessantur, pontifex in primi <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>mensis sumptum suppeditet per episcopum <placeName>Comensem</placeName> coronatorum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>viginti millia, et si protrahatur bellum longius, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>in alios menses dena millia; ipsi vicissim pontificem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>propter religionem lacessitum summissis non minus quam 6000 <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>peditum iuvent aequo acepto stipendio, quod <placeName ref="l832">Gallico</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>et imprimis <placeName ref="l862">Helvetico</placeName> foedere salvo fieri queat etc.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Addit ille comitem <persName>Egmundum</persName> vix ex <placeName ref="l875">Hispania</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>redeuntem oppida quaedam in <placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName> et <placeName ref="l2529">Brabantiae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><placeName ref="l640">Flandriaeque</placeName> confiniis velut ad bellum instruere coepisse, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>quocirca regem dedisse in mandatis <placeName>Condensi</placeName> principi, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ut quamprimum in suam praesentiam, nempe in <placeName ref="l2589">Picardiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName ref="l378">Lutetia</placeName> redeat et Ambiones totumque illum tractum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>muniat, sicut ex <persName>Philippi</persName> parte muniri omnia videt etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Scribit praeter naves aliquot <placeName ref="l2510">Turcicas</placeName> Occitanam <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>oram (<placeName ref="l2702">Langendocken</placeName>) infestare nuper coepisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Ich dancken üch fast früntlich umb üwer gehapte muͤ<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>y und tägliche arbeit, die ir noch habend in <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>miner sach gägen <persName>Arnolden</persName> seligen.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Bitten fast <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>früntlich, ir wöllind also fürfaren und by minen <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>herren bürgermeistern und <persName>Paulo Paul</persName> ernstlich <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>mitt bitten anhallten etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Setzstab hat zuͦ <placeName ref="l2428">Ragatz</placeName> gar <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>nüt me funden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Der brieff, daruff <persName>Vogler</persName> und <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><persName ref="p18324">Wyssenbach</persName> habend (zeigt Wyssenbach an selbs), lige <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>zuͦ <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName> hinder dem möntzmeister und sy nitt <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>hie.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">So habend wir ein pott angelegt uß üwerm <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>geheyß und radt uff die schmaltzbrieff, so hie ligen<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>d hinder <persName ref="p19631">Heinrychen Murer</persName>; der hat daruff <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>92 gl. (gulden), sind noch inn 250 gl. überig oder ettwas me; <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>habend aber gar vil burger vor uns pott angelegt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Dorumb hälffend, was ir könend; ich wils, wo ich <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>kan, verdienen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Ich plag üch mitt sömlichen <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>sachen nitt gern; so ich aber unschuldig in <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>die sach kummen bin und nieman dan üch droben <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>hab, wie kan ich imm thuͦn?</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Dorum verzyhend <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>mir.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Gott mitt üch.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">8. iunii 1565.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Non relegi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
